    "detailed_description": "<strong>2064</strong><br>The world is engulfed in mutated flora, eager to entirely annihilate fauna and reclaim its dominion. The surviving humans have divided into two camps - those who submit to nature and those who resist it. In these conditions, a group of surviving scientists creates a new weapon, but one day it escapes the laboratory and encounters one of the surviving individuals who has lost all purpose in existence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712350/extras/9adafadecc2b87ddf8cf4ced73dbef49.avif?t=1707984037\" width=515 height=89 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GALDAN:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Uses melee and ranged weapons<br></li><li>Can interact with the world<br></li><li>A survivor whose attitudes are still worth comprehending for the player</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CEDR:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Uses and subordinates nature<br></li><li>It can interact with plants<br></li><li>Someone who has a rare opportunity to help people</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712350/extras/9adafadecc2b87ddf8cf4ced73dbef49.avif?t=1707984037\" width=515 height=89 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve problems and get to know the history<br></li><li>Find out how people survived in such conditions and use their knowledge<br></li><li>Do everything to save <span class=\"bb_strike\">or destroy</span> the world</li></ul><br><strong><u>It's up to you to decide how the story of the heroes turns out</u></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>2064</strong><br>The world is engulfed in mutated flora, eager to entirely annihilate fauna and reclaim its dominion. The surviving humans have divided into two camps - those who submit to nature and those who resist it. In these conditions, a group of surviving scientists creates a new weapon, but one day it escapes the laboratory and encounters one of the surviving individuals who has lost all purpose in existence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712350/extras/9adafadecc2b87ddf8cf4ced73dbef49.avif?t=1707984037\" width=515 height=89 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GALDAN:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Uses melee and ranged weapons<br></li><li>Can interact with the world<br></li><li>A survivor whose attitudes are still worth comprehending for the player</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CEDR:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Uses and subordinates nature<br></li><li>It can interact with plants<br></li><li>Someone who has a rare opportunity to help people</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712350/extras/9adafadecc2b87ddf8cf4ced73dbef49.avif?t=1707984037\" width=515 height=89 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve problems and get to know the history<br></li><li>Find out how people survived in such conditions and use their knowledge<br></li><li>Do everything to save <span class=\"bb_strike\">or destroy</span> the world</li></ul><br><strong><u>It's up to you to decide how the story of the heroes turns out</u></strong>",
